{"game": "space-marine-2011", "language": "english", "appid": 55150, "month": "2022-10", "window": 3, "start_date": 1665878400, "end_date": 1666569599, "month_true_total": 133, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-09 18:02:22 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "124278574", "author": {"steamid": "76561198137996350", "personaname": "Major Payne", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198137996350/", "num_games_owned": 616, "num_reviews": 87, "playtime_forever": 643, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 492, "last_played": 1666783633, "avatar": "a26b8b234f31e16586e18b6178ab2a658b4aa496"}, "language": "english", "review": "Amazing game that can be truly appreciated only in case you have some slight idea about the lore of Warhammer 40k. Just make sure you don't buy it for 60$ - that is not the price for a 10 y.o. game", "timestamp_created": 1666537945, "timestamp_updated": 1666537945, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "124272012", "author": {"steamid": "76561198304371219", "personaname": "Draconian", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198304371219/", "num_games_owned": 463, "num_reviews": 31, "playtime_forever": 21941, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2481, "last_played": 1782187814, "avatar": "06f3efdbec02f5cae04cfd20f9768c77a9f8a395"}, "language": "english", "review": "Good game, but lower the price ffs", "timestamp_created": 1666529433, "timestamp_updated": 1706142893, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "124267782", "author": {"steamid": "76561198116732858", "personaname": "Skoll-Cerberus", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198116732858/", "num_games_owned": 411, "num_reviews": 13, "playtime_forever": 494, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 494, "last_played": 1666523123, "avatar": "76e95cfd8140d029c75ec63a08e2f1d9cf02cbbb"}, "language": "english", "review": "It's a fun short story. One of those wonderful old school games that is content to let you play it once and then move on. The combat is fun and varies between letting you wade through enemy hoards and having to utilise cover to survive an encounter. The story itself is engaging and not to long. The game puts you into the action while taking moments to let you enjoy the impressive locations of the 40k lore. Graphics hold up surprisingly well. There's a good choice of weapons so you can customise your playstyle somewhat. \n\nI'd happily recommend it even by today's standards.", "timestamp_created": 1666523380, "timestamp_updated": 1666523380, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "124263293", "author": {"steamid": "76561198336823726", "personaname": "Papachilli", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198336823726/", "num_games_owned": 149, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 478, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 477, "last_played": 1742647278, "avatar": "08d61aff46187d42be022f0c8cc674783dfa4177"}, "language": "english", "review": "Great depiction of the Warhammer 40k universe, sweet FA content after you play the 6 hour campaign though. Multiplayer is (obviously) a ghost town, so unless you have a group of 6-8+ friends online who all want to play this game, the DLC is useless. I thought \"anniversary edition\" would have some DLC that wasn't skins and game mode options for online MP. But no... get it on a steam sale. \n\nCan't wait for the upcoming sequel though. Hopefully more than 6 hours of content this time. Maybe actually getting to experience the multiplayer will be good.", "timestamp_created": 1666516386, "timestamp_updated": 1666516386, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "124240084", "author": {"steamid": "76561198041450463", "personaname": "GravKttyXD!", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/deadly7864/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 94, "playtime_forever": 769, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 552, "last_played": 1670409102, "avatar": "6ca25f083fb147c8309e5049c8bbd6308d3a2e0a"}, "language": "english", "review": "Play this master piece today, tomorrow you may be dead.\nIt's like modern doom but 3rd person and it's BEAUTIFUL. Best action game I have played in a long time. \nAlso online community is still active and PvP is really really fun.", "timestamp_created": 1666475156, "timestamp_updated": 1696192159, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}]}